        "subject": "LU-20297 build: improve Ubuntu out-of-the-box experience",
        "message": "LU-20297 build: improve Ubuntu out-of-the-box experience\n\nA fresh install of Ubuntu with the primary build pre-requisites and\nthe linux-headers-* packages installed does not build Lustre clients\ndue to include searches not finding the generated headers.\n\nImprove the experience by adding the $LINUX_OBJ/* paths as needed.\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial\nSigned-off-by: Shaun Tancheff <shaun.tancheff@hpe.com>\nChange-Id: I8378c3cb0eb3f56e5a7787f1403ecfc2e99412b8\nReviewed-on: https://review.whamcloud.com/c/fs/lustre-release/+/66086\nTested-by: jenkins <devops@whamcloud.com>\nReviewed-by: Minh <mdiep@thelustrecollective.com>\nReviewed-by: Oleg Drokin <green@whamcloud.com>\nReviewed-by: Andreas Dilger <adilger@thelustrecollective.com>\nTested-by: Maloo <maloo@whamcloud.com>\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
    }
